DESCRIPTION:Nadine Froughi is a Daydreamer.\n\\n\nIn this\, her debut comed
 y hour\, she’ll take you on a multimedia musical-comedy romp through the 
 no-man’s land between real life and her daydreams.\n\\n\nQuestions like\,
  “Where is she really from?” “Who’s the world’s most famous frog?
 ” and “Did this bit really need a PowerPoint presentation?” will be a
 sked and answered in an hour of comedy that’s high-energy\, relatable and
  ever so slightly sincere.\n\\n\nExpect songs about things that probably do
 n’t need them\, a splash of cultural confusion\, a healthy dose of femini
 ne rage and potentially a little too much insight into why this woman is St
 ill Single™️.\n\\n\nThis show is for situationship survivors\, PowerPoi
 nt aficionados\, karaoke overachievers\, and anyone who’s ever wondered i
 f the grass was greener on the other side.\n\\n\nNB: She’ll be performing
  the majority of this show in her regular accent.\n\\n\nMore info: https://
 comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/nadine-froughi-daydreamer/
